warning[K0164]: '==' compares a value with itself
 --> lint_warning.km:3:8
  |
1 | void main()
2 |     let y = 3
3 |     if y == y then
  |        ^ '==' compares a value with itself
  = help: Compare against a different value.
  = why: Comparing a value with itself always gives the same answer, so it is almost always a typo.
  = explain: run `komodo explain K0164` for more detail
